      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "AuroraQ",
        "name": "Twofold Hex",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Aurora sends out a missile that curses any enemies it hits. She can then recast the ability to draw active curses back toward herself, damaging foes who are hit along the way.",
        "bodyHtml": "Fire cursed energy in a direction, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(45/70/95/120/145 + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to enemies and cursing them for 3.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast:</span> End the curse, drawing back part of the enemy's spirit to Aurora, dealing up to <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(67.5/105/142.5/180/217.5 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to enemies passed through based on their missing Health. Damage beyond the first hit is reduced to 20%.<br /><br />If the duration runs out, Aurora will automatically <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> the Ability.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Recast deals 40% damage to minions and monsters.</span>",
