        "name": "Across the Veil",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Aurora leaps in a direction of her choosing, entering the spirit realm upon landing, becoming invisible, and gaining Move Speed for a short duration of time.",
        "bodyHtml": "Hop in a direction. Upon landing, enter the spirit realm, becoming <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisible</span> for 1/1.15/1.3/1.45/1.6 seconds and entering <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Realm Hopper</span>, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">20/25/30/35/40% Move Speed</span>.<br /><br />Scoring a takedown on an enemy champion resets this Ability's Cooldown.",
