      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "AuroraR",
        "name": "Between Worlds",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Aurora leaps in a direction of her choosing, releasing a shockwave that damages and slows any enemies it hits. Afterward, she creates an area that slows enemies within it and allows Aurora to teleport from one side of the area to the other.",
        "bodyHtml": "Leap in a direction. Upon landing, Aurora converges the realms, sending out a pulse of spirit energy that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(175/275/375 + (70% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> enemies hit by 30% for 2 seconds.<br /><br />The area of convergence stays active for 2.5/3.25/4 seconds, granting Aurora <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Realm Hopper</span> for 3.5/4.25/5 seconds, allowing her to jump from one edge of the area to another.<br /><br />Enemies attempting to enter or leave the area are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 50% for 1.5/1.75/2 seconds.<br /><br />Aurora can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability to end the effect early.",
